# Copy to .env.local for local builds, or set as a GitHub Actions repo variable
# (vars.VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY) for the deploy. Non-secret: it's the public half
# of the Web Push VAPID keypair, baked into the bundle so the browser can
# subscribe. When unset, the "Match alerts" opt-in hides itself.
#
# Generate a keypair with: npx web-push generate-vapid-keys
VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
